Comment: 0,0:22:14.98,0:22:15.02,Encerramento,,0,0,0,sync,ED
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.48,0:22:18.11,Encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur5\bord4\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H10&\an8}Quero encontrar aquela parte de você{見つけたい まだ知らない}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.11,0:22:20.70,Encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur5\bord4\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H10&\an8}Que eu ainda não conheço{君を探してる}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.70,0:22:23.24,Encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur5\bord4\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H10&\an8}Tenho tanta coisa para falar{話したいことばかりで}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.24,0:22:25.95,Encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur5\bord4\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H10&\an8}E o tempo não para de passar{時間が過ぎてゆく}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.95,0:22:27.91,Encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur5\bord4\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H10&\an8}E amanhã, neste lugar{明日も ここで}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.91,0:22:31.08,Encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur5\bord4\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H10&\an8}Espero poder te encontrar{同じ場所で会えるように}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.08,0:22:32.21,Encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur5\bord4\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H10&\an8}Goodbye{Good-bye}{Eu gosto da ideia de deixar em inglês.}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.47,0:22:44.39,Encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur5\bord4\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H10&\an8}Em uma roupa larga{XXLサイズ }
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.39,0:22:47.60,Encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur5\bord4\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H10&\an8}Neste momento, dentro do meu peito{胸の内を今も}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.60,0:22:49.56,Encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur5\bord4\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H10&\an8}Longe de onde possam ver{見えない様にと}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.56,0:22:52.73,Encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur5\bord4\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H10&\an8}Completamente escondido{覆い隠した}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.73,0:22:54.73,Encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur5\bord4\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H10&\an8}Qualquer coisa basta{なんでも良いけれど}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.73,0:22:57.61,Encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur5\bord4\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H10&\an2}Mas, com uma camada entre nós{一枚隔てたら}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.61,0:23:01.86,Encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur5\bord4\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H10&\an2}Conseguirei ouvir seus verdadeiros sentimentos{本音がきけるから}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.07,0:23:04.53,Encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur5\bord4\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H10&\an8}Fiction, Non-fiction{フィクション / ノンフィクション}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.53,0:23:07.33,Encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur5\bord4\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&HFFFFFF&\alpha&H10&\an8}Dentro delas pode haver realidade{事実も中にはあるかもしれない？}{Fato... Verdade... Realidade... Não sei qual encaixaria melhor }
